{"words": [{"text": "وَلَن", "translation": "And never"}, {"text": "تَرْضَىٰ", "translation": "will be pleased"}, {"text": "عَنكَ", "translation": "with you"}, {"text": "ٱلْيَهُودُ", "translation": "the Jews"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and [not]"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ", "translation": "the Christians"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "تَتَّبِعَ", "translation": "you follow"}, {"text": "مِلَّتَهُمْ ۗ", "translation": "their religion"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "هُدَى", "translation": "(the) Guidance"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "it"}, {"text": "ٱلْهُدَىٰ ۗ", "translation": "(is) the Guidance"}, {"text": "وَلَئِنِ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعْتَ", "translation": "you follow"}, {"text": "أَهْوَآءَهُم", "translation": "their desires"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "جَآءَكَ", "translation": "has come to you"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِلْمِ ۙ", "translation": "the knowledge"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "لَكَ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "any"}, {"text": "وَلِىٍّۢ", "translation": "protector"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "نَصِيرٍ", "translation": "any helper"}], "sahih": "And never will the Jews and the Christians approve of you until you follow their religion. Say, \"Indeed, the guidance of Allāh is the [only] guidance.\" If you were to follow their desires after what has come to you of knowledge, you would have against Allāh no protector or helper."}